  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Clearly&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is not differentiable at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence the ordered pair is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
